# Pavilion vs SHMS deploys

**Pavilion** = product (demo/marketing/trials on robert-4220).  
**SHMS** = customer #1 (www on treasurer). Separate env walls.

- **pavilion** = product author + demo stack  
- **shmspto** = customer tree; promote from pavilion when updating live school  

## Pavilion ships (this workspace)

```bash
node scripts/ship-pavilion.mjs --target commons-pto-demo
```

Demo ship does **not** update www.

## SHMS customer ships

Promote (dry-run first): `node scripts/promote-to-shms.mjs`  
Then `~/shmspto` → `node scripts/ship-stone-hill.mjs` (live www — school-hours sensitive).

Hotfix on www → same day `--from-shms` into pavilion.

Never put Stone Hill Wix / Square on Pavilion, or Pavilion Stripe on Stone Hill.

At session start: `node scripts/commons-parity.mjs` is informational.

After a Pavilion-facing ship, run `node scripts/commons-surface-check.mjs` when relevant.
